{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人李亞男和王祖藍向來都是圈中的「模範夫妻」，昨日（25日）李亞男迎來42歲生日，她在社交平台分享多張慶生靚相，而向來錫老婆的「愛妻號」王祖藍，不但送上甜蜜祝福「閃盲」網民，更特意上載為老婆慶生的短片，令人不禁發笑。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&amp;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T06:01:48.857643+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T05:44:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T05:54:58.721893+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T05:54:58.721893+00:00","content_hash":"b4699b7a185421e329dded7b3659d6c8642e3940b5f12fd77beffde504e1eeaa","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}